5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if previous projects actually served the users. I'll check the post-occupancy review ratings and booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. I want to see the timetable records on rooms out of service and the booking data for specialist and general rooms as well.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'm worried about our timelines. I'll look into the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the budgets are realistic! I'll check the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the people. I'm looking at staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, since we both want booking data, we can compare notes on general versus specialist demand.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. It will show if we are building things that actually get used.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your budget data might explain why my schedules keep slipping.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I hope so! I suspect the market prices are higher than what we put on paper.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Just don't forget that the staff are the ones dealing with the fallout of these plans.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
