35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's clear: general-purpose rooms are in high demand while specialist ones sit idle. Also, projects with broad booking access rated the highest.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,I found that taking rooms out of service is costing us a fortune in off-site rentals. We can't afford more disruptions.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Outdoor work is a gamble. We've lost six weeks to weather recently, and ""comfort"" projects tend to slip by a year.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Mechanical costs are rising by twenty percent! Plus, we have no reserve for replacing old AV kit. We're underfunding.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"My technicians are wasting hours on manual window-opening because the extraction is outdated. Meanwhile, grounds staff are missing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, that sounds like a critical failure. But @Victoria, if we need general space, we must prioritize that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"True, but if the work requires off-site rentals, the ""savings"" of a cheap project vanish.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, if mechanical costs are spiking, any project with heavy HVAC will be a budget disaster.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,Exactly. We need to be very careful with any plan involving complex plant equipment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, a ""comfort"" project might slip, but a technical failure in the labs is a safety and labor issue.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We need a balance between user demand for study space and these technical necessities.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we can find a way to minimize the timetable impact, I'm open to the lab upgrades.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'm still wary of anything exposed to the elements. Outdoor paths seem like a scheduling nightmare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,And the budget for mechanicals is the biggest risk right now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The manual routines are unsustainable. The staff can't keep doing the equipment's job.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see the candidates and decide based on these risks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'll be looking for the path of least resistance regarding the calendar.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,And the most honest budget.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,And the most relief for the staff.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
